	"Name": "Clint Sells Golden Scythe",
	"Author": "NexusModsUser92384",
	"Description": "The farmer starts with 6 tools: the hoe, pickaxe, axe, watering can, trash can, and scythe. All of them can be upgraded by Clint, except for the scythe. The only way to get an upgrade for your scythe in vanilla Stardew Valley is to get to the end of the quarry mine for the Golden Scythe. This mod lets you buy that scythe from Clint, so all your starting tools can be upgraded in one place. Side effects include being able to obtain the Golden Scythe on your never-go-in-the-mines challenge/peace-of-mind run.",
